 "summary": "A series of fifty 1 W silicon planar zener diodes in the two-lead SMA surface-mount package, with nominal zener voltages from 3.3 V to 330 V. Each type is specified for zener voltage window, dynamic impedance and reverse leakage at its own test current, plus an admissible zener current IZM. 1SMA4756A is the 47 V type (44.9 V to 49.8 V at 5.5 mA).",
